  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a20105d88834d764380d6090e8c10179, type: 3}
  m_Name: Irrigation Inspection Report
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NoteData
  title: Irrigation Inspection Report
  content: 'Springtide Canal Authority

    Water pressure remains within expected
    limits.

    Canal gates, pumps, and reservoirs show no structural failures.

    Despite
    normal flow, root systems have spread into several waterways, diverting irrigation
    throughout the valley.

    Mechanical failure has been ruled out.

    Recommend
    immediate botanical investigation before further farmland is overtaken.'
